As a long-time fan of your team, I really don't want to say harsh words, but this time I can't help but complain a bit. Yesterday's series of trading strategies were just too much for me to follow:
· Tianqing suggested a long position at 3202 with a stop loss at 3160;
· Then Huaiyang opened a long position at 3155 with a stop loss at 3120;
· Next, the princess also took a long position at 3120, which also resulted in a loss;
· Tianqing recommended going long again at 3080, and that also led to a loss;
· Finally, Tianqing opened a long position at 2965, with a continued stop loss at 2920.
Are you all operating under the mindset of "there will always be a trade that can make a profit" and only showcasing the profitable trades while the ones who followed you ended up losing? Is this really fair to the fans who have always trusted you?
I'm just an ordinary retail investor, with limited power, and I can't make big waves. But this time I really couldn't hold it in anymore, which is why I decided to speak up. It's not because I want to criticize you, but because I once sincerely recognized your work, which is why I feel even more disappointed. I still hope you can take this issue seriously and be a bit more responsible for everyone's trust. #ETH
